OL,3,A'Poison seller' Kenneth Law apologises 
OL,4,Ain court to the families of his victims
OL,6,FThe Canadian man who sold toxic        
OL,7,Fchemicals through online suicide forums
OL,8,Fin 40 countries apologised in court to 
OL,9,Fthe families of the victims, saying he 
OL,10,Fdeeply regrets his actions and will    
OL,11,Fnever repeat them.                     
OL,13,FKenneth Law made the remarks on Friday 
OL,14,Fduring a sentencing hearing where      
OL,15,Fprosecutors asked a judge to give him a
OL,16,F25-year prison term.                   
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
