OL,3,A'Poison seller' Kenneth Law apologises 
OL,4,Ain court to the families of his victims
OL,6,FThe 61-year-old pleaded guilty in May  
OL,7,Fto 14 counts of aiding the suicide     
OL,8,Fdeaths of 14 people in Ontario, Canada,
OL,9,Fthough he has admitted to causing the  
OL,10,Fdeaths of dozens of victims in England 
OL,11,Fand Wales.                             
OL,13,FHe will not face charges in the UK or  
OL,14,Fover any British deaths under a plea   
OL,15,Fdeal which saw Canadian authorities    
OL,16,Fwithdraw more serious charges of       
OL,17,Fmurder.                                
